  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEstimate the product, and then check your estimate on your calculator.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e517 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18155\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 68\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eRound the numbers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eRound 517 down to 500, and 68 up to 70.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e517 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18156\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 68 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18157\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/approx.gif\"\u003e 500 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18158\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 70.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eMultiply.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eMultiply. You know 5 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18159\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 7 \u003d 35; tack on three zeros.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003d 35,000\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eCheck using your calculator.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eCheck using your calculator.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe calculator gives the value 35156, pretty close to our estimate.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_5_1_rationalnumbers_5_40/f-40-5-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
